Summary: Line-by-line calculator with live results
Description: |
  A native Android calculation workspace for working things out line by line.
  Includes live results, reusable variables, earlier-result references,
  per-line notes, automatic switching between the DeepCalc keypad and Android's
  keyboard, focused-row visibility, local sheet history, themes and palettes.

  No Internet permission, ads or analytics SDKs. Calculations and saved sheets
  are stored locally. Sharing uses the Android chooser and only happens when
  the user selects a share target.
  .
MaintainerNotes: |
  The Android Gradle Plugin is 9.3.0 and requires Gradle 9.5.0 or newer.
  Upstream CI currently builds with Gradle 9.7.0 and JDK 21.
  The build disables ABI splits to produce one universal APK for F-Droid.
  .

